ns, executive functioning challenges, peer or relationship concerns, or longstanding feelings of being misunderstood.\n            </p>\n            <p>\n              Evaluations may also be helpful for parents, schools, therapists, physicians, or other referral sources seeking diagnostic clarity and recommendations for support.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"autism-slider-nav\">\n        <label for=\"autism-slide-1\" class=\"autism-nav-dot\" aria-label=\"Slide 1\"></label>\n        <label for=\"autism-slide-2\" class=\"autism-nav-dot\" aria-label=\"Slide 2\"></label>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"autism-slider-arrows\">\n        <label for=\"autism-slide-1\" class=\"autism-arrow autism-arrow-left\">‹</label>\n        <label for=\"autism-slide-2\" class=\"autism-arrow autism-arrow-right\">›</label>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<style>\n  .autism-slider-section {\n    width: 100%;\n    padding: 56px 0;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #F6F3ED 0%, #E5F3F6 100%);\n  }\n\n  .autism-slider-container {\n    max-width: 1120px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 0 20px;\n  }\n\n  .autism-slider-intro {\n    max-width: 760px;\n    margin: 0 auto 34px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .autism-slider-eyebrow {\n    margin: 0 0 10px;\n    font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n    letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: #9D654E;\n    font-weight: 600;\n  }\n\n  .autism-slider-intro h2 {\n    margin: 0 0 14px;\n    font-family: 'Spectral SC', serif;\n    font-size: 42px;\n    line-height: 1.15;\n    font-weight: 300;\n    color: #2B5275;\n  }\n\n  .autism-slider-intro p {\n    margin: 0;\n    font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n    color: #3D2D29;\n  }\n\n  .autism-slider {\n    position: relative;\n    max-width: 900px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    border-radius: 26px;\n    box-shadow: 0 18px 45px rgba(43, 82, 117, 0.16);\n    background-color: #FFFFFF;\n  }\n\n  .autism-slider input {\n    display: none;\n  }\n\n  .autism-slides {\n    display: flex;\n    width: 200%;\n    transition: transform 0.55s ease;\n  }\n\n  .autism-slide {\n    width: 50%;\n    min-height: 410px;\n    padding: 48px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n\n  .autism-slide-one {\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFFFFF 0%, #F6F3ED 100%);\n  }\n\n  .autism-slide-two {\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFFFFF 0%, #E5F3F6 100%);\n  }\n\n  .autism-slide-content {\n    max-width: 700px;\n  }\n\n  .autism-slide-number {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    width: 48px;\n    height: 48px;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background-color: #2B5275;\n    color: #FFFFFF;\n    font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n  }\n\n  .autism-slide h3 {\n    margin: 0 0 18px;\n    font-family: 'Spectral SC', serif;\n    font-size: 34px;\n    line-height: 1.18;\n    font-weight: 300;\n    color: #2B5275;\n  }\n\n  .autism-slide p {\n    margin: 0 0 14px;\n    font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    line-height: 1.85;\n    color: #3D2D29;\n  }\n\n  .autism-slide p:last-child {\n    margin-bottom: 0;\n  }\n\n  #autism-slide-1:checked ~ .autism-slides {\n    transform: translateX(0);\n  }\n\n  #autism-slide-2:checked ~ .autism-slides {\n    transform: translateX(-50%);\n  }\n\n  .autism-slider-nav {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 24px;\n    left: 50%;\n    transform: translateX(-50%);\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 10px;\n  }\n\n  .autism-nav-dot {\n    width: 11px;\n    height: 11px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background-color: rgba(43, 82, 117, 0.28);\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: all 0.25s ease;\n  }\n\n  #autism-slide-1:checked ~ .autism-slider-nav label[for=\"autism-slide-1\"],\n  #autism-slide-2:checked ~ .autism-slider-nav label[for=\"autism-slide-2\"] {\n    background-color: #2B5275;\n    transform: scale(1.2);\n  }\n\n  .autism-slider-arrows {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 50%;\n    left: 0;\n    right: 0;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    padding: 0 18px;\n    transform: translateY(-50%);\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n\n  .autism-arrow {\n    width: 42px;\n    height: 42px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.86);\n    color: #2B5275;\n    font-size: 34px;\n    line-height: 36px;\n    text-align: center;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    pointer-events: auto;\n    box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(43, 82, 117, 0.15);\n  }\n\n  .autism-arrow-left {\n    visibility: hidden;\n  }\n\n  #autism-slide-2:checked ~ .autism-slider-arrows .autism-arrow-left {\n    visibility: visible;\n  }\n\n  #autism-slide-2:checked ~ .autism-slider-arrows .autism-arrow-right {\n    visibility: hidden;\n  }\n\n  @media screen and (max-width: 760px) {\n    .autism-slider-section {\n      padding: 38px 0;\n    }\n\n    .autism-slider-intro h2 {\n      font-size: 32px;\n    }\n\n    .autism-slide {\n      min-height: 520px;\n      padding: 34px 28px 70px;\n      align-items: flex-start;\n    }\n\n    .autism-slide h3 {\n      font-size: 27px;\n    }\n\n    .autism-slide p {\n      font-size: 15px;\n      line-height: 1.75;\n    }\n\n    .autism-slider-arrows {\n      top: auto;\n      bottom: 18px;\n      transform: none;\n      padding: 0 24px;\n    }\n\n    .autism-slider-nav {\n      bottom: 30px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>",
